{
  "id": "ISA.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 26",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day shall this song be sung in the land of Judah: We have a strong city; salvation will he appoint for walls and bulwarks. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Open ye the gates, that the righteous nation which keepeth faith may enter in. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt keep ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in perfect peace, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mind ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " stayed ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; because he trusteth in thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Trust ye in Jehovah for ever; for in Jehovah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Jehovah, is an everlasting rock. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he hath brought down them that dwell on high, the lofty city: he layeth it low, he layeth it low even to the ground; he bringeth it even to the dust. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The foot shall tread it down; even the feet of the poor, and the steps of the needy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The way of the just is uprightness: thou that art upright dost direct the path of the just.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, in the way of thy judgments, O Jehovah, have we waited for thee; to thy name, even to thy memorial ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", is the desire of our soul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With my soul have I desired thee in the night; yea, with my spirit within me will I seek thee earnestly: for when thy judgments are in the earth, the inhabitants of the world learn righteousness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let favor be showed to the wicked, yet will he not learn righteousness; in the land of uprightness will he deal wrongfully, and will not behold the majesty of Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehovah, thy hand is lifted up, yet they see not: but they shall see ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " zeal for the people, and be put to shame; yea, fire shall devour thine adversaries. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehovah, thou wilt ordain peace for us; for thou hast also wrought all our works for us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah our God, other lords besides thee have had dominion over us; but by thee only will we make mention of thy name. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " dead, they shall not live; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " deceased, they shall not rise: therefore hast thou visited and destroyed them, and made all remembrance of them to perish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast increased the nation, O Jehovah, thou hast increased the nation; thou art glorified; thou hast enlarged all the borders of the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehovah, in trouble have they visited thee; they poured out a prayer ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " thy chastening was upon them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like as a woman with child, that draweth near the time of her delivery, is in pain and crieth out in her pangs; so we have been before thee, O Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have been with child, we have been in pain, we have as it were brought forth wind; we have not wrought any deliverance in the earth; neither have the inhabitants of the world fallen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy dead shall live; my dead bodies shall arise. Awake and sing, ye that dwell in the dust; for thy dew is ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the dew of herbs, and the earth shall cast forth the dead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, my people, enter thou into thy chambers, and shut thy doors about thee: hide thyself for a little moment, until the indignation be overpast. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, behold, Jehovah cometh forth out of his place to punish the inhabitants of the earth for their iniquity: the earth also shall disclose her blood, and shall no more cover her slain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ISA.27",
    "number": "27",
    "bookId": "ISA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ISA.25",
